{"id":"623276","name":"豆渣红枣馒头","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/623276/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"800克"},{"name":"豆渣","amount":"400克"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"10克"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"12颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"绿豆渣。","img":"images/623276/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红枣清洗干净备用。","img":"images/623276/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"绿豆渣、面粉和玉米面混合，放入酵母粉，加入温水。","img":"images/623276/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和成软硬适中的面团，静置发酵。","img":"images/623276/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"这个状态，面团已经发酵好了。","img":"images/623276/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"移至面板，揉匀排气。","img":"images/623276/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分成小剂子。","img":"images/623276/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取一份揉圆形。","img":"images/623276/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"按下一颗红枣。","img":"images/623276/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"依次做好","img":"images/623276/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"摆放到蒸锅，水开后蒸20分钟焖3分钟。","img":"images/623276/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到，出锅。","img":"images/623276/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"可做三餐主食。","img":"images/623276/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"用35–40度温水和面。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}